{"product_id":"jaguar","title":"Jaguar Smart Watch","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Jaguar Smartwatch combines cutting-edge technology with sleek design to offer a premium wearable experience. Equipped with a 1.96-inch TFT display, this smartwatch delivers sharp visuals and easy navigation. It boasts a range of health tracking features such as heart rate monitoring, blood pressure tracking, and SP02 measurement, helping you stay on top of your fitness goals. With extended battery life, a variety of smart features like music control, camera access, and weather updates, as well as a sturdy zinc alloy body, the Jaguar \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch in Pakistan\u003c\/a\u003e is the perfect blend of functionality and style for tech enthusiasts and fitness lovers alike.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Jaguar Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleek, square design with an impressive 1.96-inch TFT display.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExtensive health monitoring features, including heart rate, blood pressure, SP02, sleep tracking, and more.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOffers customizable watch faces, with both cloud-based and built-in options.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSupports multiple sports modes for an active lifestyle.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdvanced smart features like music control, camera control, weather updates, and more.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Jaguar Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDisplay Size: 1.96 inches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eScreen Type: TFT\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResolution: 240x282\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenu View Styles: 8\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eConnectivity:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Version: BLE 5.3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Transmission Range: 8-10 meters\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWatch Application Support (Android\/iOS): Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Method: Magnet\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Type: 552022-250mAH\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharge Time: 3 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWorking Time: About 7-9 days\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStandby Time: About 20 days\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003ePhysical Specifications:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShape: Square\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWatch Body Material: Zinc Alloy\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStrap Material: Silica Gel\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight: 40.8g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater Resistance Rating: IP67\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eHealth Monitoring Features:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlood Pressure Monitoring: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSP02 Monitoring: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Monitoring: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBreathe Training: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Female Function: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOxygen Monitor: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalories Consumption: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSmart Features:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWatch Faces: 100+ Cloud-based, 7+1 Static, Support Animated Faces, DIY Watch Face\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSports Modes: 123 Built-in\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMultilingual Support: 27+ Languages\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGames: 4 (2048, Floppy, Hamster, Battleship)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOTA Firmware Upgrade: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSiri Assistance: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMusic: Control and Play Music from Watch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCamera Control: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeather Updates: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAlarm: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlash Light: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalculator: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLCD Lightness Adjustment: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTheater Mode\/DND Mode: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePedometer: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSedentary Reminder: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDrink Water Reminder: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMotion Gesture Display Activation: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eText Messages Notification: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIncoming Call\/Messaging Alert: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSynchronize Contacts and Call Records: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSplit Screen: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFind Device\/Find Mobile Phone: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTheme Mode: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStopwatch\/Countdown: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Jaguar Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eComprehensive Health Monitoring:\u003c\/strong\u003e Keep track of essential health metrics such as heart rate, blood pressure, SP02, and sleep, ensuring that you stay informed about your well-being.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Connectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e Stay connected with easy access to music, camera control, voice assistant (Siri), and a wide range of notifications right from your wrist.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLong Battery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e Enjoy up to 9 days of battery life on a single charge, ensuring reliability for daily use.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDurable \u0026amp; Stylish:\u003c\/strong\u003e Featuring a zinc alloy body and water resistance rating of IP67, the Jaguar Smartwatch combines style with robustness.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black Metal","offer_id":49616248373526,"sku":"20918","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Starlight Silver Metal","offer_id":49616248537366,"sku":"20919","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue Metal","offer_id":49616248439062,"sku":"20920","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Orange","offer_id":49616248406294,"sku":"20923","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Orange","offer_id":49616248471830,"sku":"20921","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Gray Orange","offer_id":49616248504598,"sku":"20922","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Jaguar_1_1_d75eb334-0550-4b21-8804-eba296365658.webp?v=1762935821","url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/products\/jaguar","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}